  "updateinfo_id": "ALSA-2026:67584",
  "description": "The rsyslog packages provide an enhanced, multi-threaded syslog daemon. It supports MySQL, syslog/TCP, RFC 3195, permitted sender lists, filtering on any message part, and fine-grained control over output format.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * rsyslog: A configuration-dependent issue in rsyslog's optional imptcp input module can allow an unauthenticated remote peer to crash rsyslogd (CVE-2026-19654)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
  "fromstr": "packager@almalinux.org",
  "issued_date": {
    "$date": 1789430400000
  },
